    "lec-19-q4b": {"prompt":"\\text{Let }\\,u=x+y\\text{, }\\,v=x-y\\text{ (i.e. }\\,x=\\tfrac{u+v}2\\text{, }\\,y=\\tfrac{u-v}2\\text{). Find the Jacobian }\\dfrac{\\partial(x,y)}{\\partial(u,v)}"},
